  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 28-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 dielectric stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2 (28 finite layers). Initialize HfO2 layer thicknesses from Gaussian distribution centered at 180 nm with standard deviation 30 nm, bounded 150-210 nm. Initialize SiO2 layer thicknesses from Gaussian distribution centered at 60 nm with standard deviation 15 nm, bounded 45-75 nm. Use gradient_thickness optimizer with mutation step size increased by 20% relative to default. Evaluate at normal incidence, unpolarized light. Maximize mean transmittance over 1000-1700 nm band and maximize mean reflectance over 300-450 nm band. Report best_target_score, valid_candidates count, tightest_margin, and thicknesses_nm for all candidates. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 300-450 nm, 1000-1700 nm. soft objectives: high transmission in 1000-1700 nm; high reflection in 300-450 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: low transmission in 300-450 nm; low reflection in 1000-1700 nm. manufacturing constraints: total layer count <= 30; materials restricted to HfO2 and SiO2.",
